@baseUrl = https://api.sleeper.app/v1
@username = HenrykManente
@userId = 1050514781800734720
@season = 2026
@leagueId = replace_with_league_id

### Descobrir a temporada e a semana atuais da NFL
GET {{baseUrl}}/state/nfl
Accept: application/json

### Resolver IDs de quarterbacks ativos; prefira filtros para reduzir a resposta
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/nfl?position=QB&active=true
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário por username
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{username}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário por user_id
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar ligas NFL do usuário na temporada
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}/leagues/nfl/{{season}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar detalhes da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar rosters da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Listar membros da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}/users
Accept: application/json
